prompt adversarially verify a claimed defect -- seed_link RED at tools/s/seed_link_witness.rish:44, ratchet 857 against a ceiling of 848 -- and try to refute it
think Ran the guard on metal. It refuses at line 44 with the message the claim quotes, and the scan exits 1 with other_living_links_outside_seed=857, other_living_ceiling=848, front_door_links_outside_seed=0, verdict=link_outside_seed. The claim reproduces.
think Tested whether the dirty working tree caused it. The tree carried two modified submodules and one untracked log; tools/fixtures/seed_link_scan.sh line 58 reads git ls-files '*.md', so untracked files cannot reach the count, and no tracked .md was modified. Built a pristine git worktree at HEAD 64c7f4bf40 and read the same 857 against 848 there.
think Tested the four named escape hatches. Dated testimony is already freed at scan lines 97 and 109, and the flagged files are living rules rather than stamped artifacts. template-manifest.bron carries no allow construction and no allow PUBKEYS.md -- only allow PUBKEYS.template.md at line 149 -- while allow .claude at line 145 has no sub_exclude, so the flagged documents genuinely ship into rooms the seed genuinely withholds. No exemption is written anywhere: seed_link sits on the standing roster at construction/standing-equipment.kyri line 144, and construction/REDS.md books no row for it.
think HEAD moved twice while the checks ran -- 7f83db7e58 to 64c7f4bf40 -- so a second hand was committing into this checkout during the verification. Recorded rather than acted on, per REDS %291.
obs The defect holds and the diagnosis does not. The claim reads the scan's five printed lines as the offenders, yet tools/fixtures/seed_link_scan.sh line 111 caps printing at five -- if (ratchet <= 5) -- so those are the first five in git ls-files order, and .claude sorts first. Running a copy with the cap lifted gives the real distribution across all 857: external-research/yonder/strengthening-compiler 509, context 153, docs 18, bibliography.md 16, MAP.md 15, external-research 10, caravan 10, context/specs 9, .claude/rules 9. The nine agent-rule links equal the nine-over overage by coincidence rather than by cause.
obs The claimed fix would edit five long-standing links, leave 852 against 848 still RED, and never touch what raised the count. Two better-supported causes: .claude/rules/quality-assurance.md landed 2026-08-24 in bb09a9823, after the ceiling was measured 20260823, and template-manifest.bron changed three times today -- adb3f7b3f, 41a4b0950, 4af925691 -- which moves the shipped-document set the ratchet reads across.
obs The roster had already caught this. construction/standing-equipment-reds/seed_link.txt holds the same line-44 refusal verbatim, so the guard reported honestly and the record of it simply had not become a REDS row yet.
obs A witness that prints a bounded sample reads, to a hurrying eye, as a witness that prints the population. The cap is correct engineering and the label around it is what misleads; a printed sample is worth naming as a sample beside the count it was drawn from.
